-- 3 {"commit": "15a4be72485124114f8b318f9be22936e6c45c11", "finding": "TypeDisambiguator.forTypecaseClause (ProjectFortress/src/com/sun/fortress/compiler/disambiguator/TypeDisambiguator.java:247-249 at 307c1ab69) cleared forTypecaseClause only after recursing into the clause's body. An undeclared bare type name in an arm's body was therefore let through as a candidate binding. `y: Nonesuch = x` in an arm gave 'CompilerBuiltin.fsi:210:7-9: Nonesuch is not in the kind env [][][]' on the compiled path and 'Missing type Nonesuch' at run time under walk. This is row 626's mechanism at a sibling site in the file the rung edits. The flags are now cleared before the body is walked.", "kind": "defect", "paths": ["ProjectFortress/src/com/sun/fortress/compiler/disambiguator/TypeDisambiguator.java", "ProjectFortress/compiler_tests/XXXTypecaseBodyUndeclaredType.fss", "ProjectFortress/compiler_tests/XXXTypecaseBodyUndeclaredType.test", "explorations/compile-ladder/rung-checker-overloading/record.md"], "settledBy": "", "test": "XXXTypecaseBodyUndeclaredType.test. Failing on the worker's code: `junit.sh skhead ...` -> 'ProjectFortress/LibraryBuiltin/CompilerBuiltin.fsi:210:7-9:', 'Nonesuch is not in the kind env [][][]', ' Saw failure, but did not satisfy compile_err_contains; expected', 'Nonesuch is undefined.'. Passing after the build: `junit.sh skfix ...` -> 'XXXTypecaseBodyUndeclaredType.fss:7:12-18:', 'Nonesuch is undefined.', ' Saw expected failure', 'OK (28 tests)'."}
